{"sections":[{"slug":"同伦范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"同伦范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">同伦范畴</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“同伦范畴”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">动机</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/无穷范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">无穷范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">将通过</span> $2$-<span lang=\"zh\">态射相连的两个态射等同起来</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">就得到一个普通范畴</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">拓扑空间</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/奇异单纯集","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">奇异单纯集</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\operatorname{Sing}(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拟范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" (<span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/无穷范畴的模型","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">无穷范畴的模型</span>"}},{"Plain":"), <span lang=\"zh\">其同伦范畴</span> $\\operatorname{hSing}(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/基本群胚","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">基本群胚</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\pi_{\\leq 1}(X)$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/范畴的局部化","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴的局部化</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}